+---
+id: task-002-fix-coupon-base-coupon-last-day-shipping-vat-report
+type: task
+title: "Fix coupon base, coupon last day; shipping VAT report"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Three reports.
+
+1. Finance, coupon too generous: the percentage coupon was computed on the gross amount instead of the
+   subtotal after volume discounts (README: Discounts). `priceOrder` now uses `grossTotal - volumeTotal`.
+   12 notebooks at €5.00 with 10%: €48.60.
+2. Luca, AUTUMN refused on its last day: `Coupons.redeemable` used `>=` against `validUntil`; the last
+   day is included, now `>`.
+3. Anna, VAT on shipping: NOT changed. README (Shipping, VAT) says shipping is subject to 22% VAT, shown
+   on its own line, and the README prevails over the code. Dropping it is a business/tax decision and
+   needs the README updated by someone who owns the rule. Left for the requester to confirm.
+
+Tests (red first): new `coupon rules` in `test/rules.test.ts`.
